Third-Party Components

SnowOS includes and references the following open-source projects:

- WhiteSur GTK Theme: https://github.com/vinceliuice/WhiteSur-gtk-theme (GPL-3.0)
- WhiteSur Icon Theme: https://github.com/vinceliuice/WhiteSur-icon-theme (GPL-3.0)
- Blur My Shell: https://github.com/aunetx/blur-my-shell (GPL-3.0)
- Search Light: https://github.com/S3r3n1t7/search-light (GPL-3.0)
- Magic Lamp: https://github.com/laxatives/gnome-shell-extension-magic-lamp (GPL-3.0)
- Plank Dock: https://launchpad.net/plank (GPL-3.0)
- Inter Font: https://github.com/rsms/inter (OFL-1.1)
- JetBrains Mono: https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono (OFL-1.1)
- Noto Fonts: https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-fonts (OFL-1.1)
- Ubuntu: https://ubuntu.com (Various licenses)

Please refer to each project's repository for their specific license terms.